          <Pad Id="Gf6rSQagAN4OzfLCSmxCFg" Bounds="640,260,320,80" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; Tiles are off; the graticule gives the window its bearings. Switch OpenStreetMap on and its credit appears in the Attribution widget.">
