          <Pad Id="EWHl2hdcAMHFTjOGHHSi0p" Bounds="640,400,320,80" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; Click hands a press to the widgets. Handled is true while a button takes it, so Drag is gated with Left Pressed AND NOT Handled: pressing + does not also pan.">
