          <Pad Id="OUQSIIsSaCAyL9smI2DIT7" Bounds="640,520,320,80" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; ScaleBar: metric by default; Units and Corner are pins. Switch Widgets off and all three go away - the only way, since Widgets is append-only.">
